stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> THINKING

    THINKING --> WAITING: think time expired, enqueue request
    WAITING --> EATING: both forks granted, event signalled
    WAITING --> THINKING: timeout, cancel request
    EATING --> THINKING: eat time expired, release forks
    THINKING --> FINISHED: all cycles completed
    FINISHED --> [*]

    note right of WAITING
        Request is in the central queue.
        In FIFO mode later requests
        cannot overtake the head.
    end note

    note right of EATING
        Both adjacent forks are owned
        by this philosopher.
    end note
